    /* COMPACT DESKTOP GEOMETRY — profile §7 "Compact desktop CSS and repair order".
     Space only: 18px panel padding, 8px main gap, 8px/14px field gaps. Every readable floor
     holds — inputs stay >=16px text and >=44px tall, the submit stays >=48px, helpers and
     consent stay at 14px, and nothing is hidden, clipped or made to scroll internally.
