     this form carries an upload control and the wider media-consent scope that the shared hero
     form does not, so it needs the documented compact density at 864px and 900px too. Recorded
     in docs/05-CURRENT-DECISIONS.md. */
  /* RETUNED 2026-09-06 for AC-PPC-HERO-ROOMS-1.1. The free-walkthrough subtext is one line longer
     than the wording it replaced, which added 20.30px to the panel and cost 1440x900 its pass
     (clearance 22.52px → 2.22px, measured). AC-PPC-HERO-COPY-UPDATE.md permits adjusting spacing
     and padding to accommodate new wording; it forbids clipping, hiding, internal scrolling and
     shrinking text below the readable floors. This is space only:
       panel gap    8px → 6px   ·  5 visible row gaps  = 10px
       panel pad   18px → 16px  ·  top and bottom      =  4px
       grid rows    8px → 6px   ·  3 field row gaps    =  6px
     Column gap stays 14px. Every floor holds untouched — inputs >=44px tall and >=16px text, the
     submit >=48px, helper/consent/microcopy at 14px, nothing hidden or scrolled. */
  @media (min-width: 75rem) and (max-height: 950px) {
    .ppc-form {
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .ppc-form__grid {
      gap: 6px 14px;
    }
