       is the single largest saving available. Reading and tab order are unchanged — DOM order
       still runs name, phone, ZIP, email, description, photos, so the pair simply becomes the
       third row of the same left-to-right grid. */
    .ppc-form__grid > .ppc-form__field--full {
      grid-column: auto;
